  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3106.03 Effect of Revocation or Suspension on License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3106.03 Effect of Revocation or Suspension on License. If a hearings examiner revokes or suspends a driver education instructor certificate and determines that the conduct of the instructor has a direct bearing on the operation of an approved drivers’ school, a hearing shall be scheduled to determine whether to suspend or revoke the approved drivers’ school license.\n\nSource. #9568, eff 10-17-09; ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
